# ── 内部文档与开发状态：不入版本控制，避免泄漏 ──
# README.md / NOTICE.md / SKILL.md / references/ / evals/ 是仓库正式内容，保持跟踪
drafts/
notes/
private/
internal/
dev/
dev-notes/
.archive/
.research/
*.draft.md
*.local.md
*.wip.md
DEVLOG.md
TODO.md
STATUS.md

